: Stage 1 standard library internal assertion verb for StageL 3 (prohibited in StageR 3 / Stage 2).
ns std/assert.

: Traps deterministically when `cond` is false; returns `void` when `cond` is true.
: @dc l8589978237
pub v/void/assertStageLInternal b/cond
    test
        in true
        out.
        in false
        out fault.
    if /cond nop fault.
